  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "The reason code for a goods-not-received claim is **`goods_not_received`**. The dispute window for this code is 90 days from the transaction date.\n\nI found TX-0401 on your account ACC-1005: EUR 240.00 to TechMart Online, dated 2026-07-20, status settled. The same merchant and amount also appear on TX-0402 (2026-07-14). If you were charged twice for one order, the claim would be `duplicate_charge` instead, and that would apply to TX-0402 rather than TX-0401. Otherwise, use `goods_not_received` for TX-0401.\n\nWould you like me to check whether TX-0401 is eligible under this code? If it is, I can open the dispute.",
